Luna, receiving the magnified essence, understood the weight of her responsibility. She knew that if she kept the blocks for her own fortress, the bridge would collapse, isolating them both forever. Instead, she polished the golden essence and sent a generous portion back to Sol, who used it to sustain the foundation. This cycle of exchange transformed their islands into a unified sanctuary of light. They realized that the bridge was not merely a structure of stone, but a testament to their mutual reliance. Every time Sol sent his full measure, Luna responded with equal integrity, ensuring the bridge never flickered. Their partnership serves as an eternal reminder that in the grand construction of life, the strongest foundations are laid not by individual power, but by the unwavering reciprocity of two souls working in harmony.
